    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ramelton very own Auctioneers Keller Williams Donegal Team Ciaran Byrne Estate Agents  are delighted to present to let this very fine apartment within a period-built residence standing in an enviable position in the heart of Ramelton Village overlooking the River Lennon.\r\nThis apartment is within a period home on The Mall, and is a deceptively spacious, one bedroom, and apartment residence extending to approximately (800 sq. ft.). The property has been extremely well maintained by its current owners and no expense has been spared on its maintenance and decoration and the home is ready for immediate occupation.\r\nThe bright elegant accommodation benefits from an impressive entrance into a wonderfully decorated open plan living dining area with many ornate decorations and decors catching the eye.\r\nAccommodation\r\nOpen plan area divided into two defined living spaces A large living room area and a Large modern kitchen with dining table for entering. To the rear is a large opulent double-bedroom with generous wardrobe space and decorated ornate ceiling complimenting the original and restored, working shutters.\r\nThe opulent decoration continues into the en suite with luxury sanitary ware and painted walls which highlight the large brass candelabras. There is also a very large shower room with built in seating to relax and enjoy.\r\nOutside to the front you have enviable access to village life and to the rear there is a secure courtyard and various outbuilding.\r\nThis own door home on The Mall is one of Rameltons most sought after and popular residential roads, being in the heart of a thriving community and a short walk from the many excellent primary schools, cafes, shops, and restaurants in the vicinity.\r\nFeatures\r\nDelightful period-built residence, with many impressive features\r\nPrime location in the heart of Ramelton Village.\r\nHighly convenient location less than 20 minutes’ drive to Letterkenny\r\nPrivate, secluded rear courtyard.\r\nWell-proportioned accommodation of approximately.\r\nEnergy efficient Creda heating systems\r\nExcellent public transport into Letterkenny\r\nRent €1300.00 PCM."
      }
    ],
